# React / TypeScript Conventions

## Components
- Functional components with named exports
- PascalCase for component names and files
- Props as inline type parameters, not separate interface files

## State
- Zustand stores in `src/stores/`
- One store per domain: projectStore, agentStore, loopStore, wizardStore
- Use selectors to minimize re-renders

## Styling
- Tailwind CSS 4 utility classes exclusively
- Design tokens from `src/tokens.css` via `@theme`
- Token classes: bg-void, bg-surface, bg-elevated, text-primary, text-muted, text-dim, border-border
- Accent classes: text-primary (green), text-cyan, text-amber, text-red, text-purple
- Glow effects: shadow-glow-primary, shadow-glow-cyan, shadow-glow-red
- NEVER raw hex, rgb, or oklch in component code
- Font: font-mono (default), font-sans (for body text where appropriate)

## Routing
- React Router v7
- Routes: / (Home), /new/* (Wizard steps), /monitor/:projectId (Monitor)

## Tauri IPC
- Bindings in `src/lib/tauri.ts`
- Use `@tauri-apps/api/core` for invoke
- Use `@tauri-apps/api/event` for listen
